  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evidence and Research to Improve the Use of Education Technology</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project funds delivery of the Education Technology Hub, a global programme providing research, innovation and technical assistance to help improve learning outcomes in low- and middle-income countries. Through this contract, research organisations generate high-quality evidence on the effective use of digital technology in education and support partner governments to apply this evidence to policy and programme design. Activities include studies, innovation pilots, and advisory support that strengthen education systems and inform decisions on technology-enabled learning.</narrative>
  </description>
